\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Real-trainer experiments (non-IID CIFAR-10 unless stated). Accuracy is round-40 test accuracy; timely delivery ratio, bytes per round (rounds 30--39, attempted uplink), and mean delivered rank follow the definitions of Section~\ref {sec:eval}. (a) Deadline ladder. (b) Extended stress matrix, five seeds. (c) External baselines, ten seeds. (d) Scheduling arms, 1.0\,MB budget. (e) Component ablations, five seeds.}}{18}{}\protected@file@percent }
