\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Real-trainer experiments (CIFAR-10, means over seeds). (a)~At the nominal deadline all rank policies hold the pretrained-backbone accuracy. (b)~Under the 0.1\,s deadline all methods remain stable while full-model updates deliver nothing and stay at the backbone. (c)~FedRAS is link-aware: delivered rank holds 16, tracks 13, and tracks 8 under the 2.0, 0.1, and 0.05\,s deadlines, against the fixed annealing schedule of the SA-FedLoRA-style baseline. (d)~Final accuracy across datasets; the parity is not CIFAR-10-specific (numbers in Table~\ref {tab:trainermain}(b)).}}{19}{}\protected@file@percent }
